Summons a small raging volcano for [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns. Every turn, it will fire a molten boulder towards up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] of your foes, dealing [23, 31, 38, 43, 48 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire and [23, 31, 38, 43, 48 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
